sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as Kubernetes API
    participant Op as Operator
    participant K as Kubelet / runtime
    participant M as Manager
    participant Q as QEMU / guest
    User->>API: Raise CPU / memory desired size
    API-->>Op: Current generation
    Op->>Op: Check boot ceilings / plan live resize or restart
    Op->>API: Patch Pod resize subresource
    API->>K: Updated resource limits
    K-->>M: Project limits and apply cgroup resources
    M->>M: Verify effective cgroup capacity first
    M->>Q: QMP CPU/memory hotplug within boot headroom
    Q-->>M: Observed topology
    K-->>API: Pod resize conditions / applied container limits
    Op->>API: Read Pod state / publish kubelet-side resize status
    Note over M,Q: QEMU hotplug is separate from kubelet Applied status
    Note over Q: Guest CPU/memory onlining remains guest behavior
